      "writtenOn": "2021-05-11T19:28:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I see.  If the compression algorithm does not support random access (which I don\u0027t know), I guess we don\u0027t really have better options.\n\nI\u0027m also thinking resource files that the executable may use.  But in any case, the same thing should be already happening / handled by the app.",
      "parentUuid": "b6974b23_4d5b7d98",
      "range": {
